Mark of Hleid	CATEGORY:FEAT	TYPE:General	VISIBLE:YES	PRECLASS:1,TYPE.Base=4		PREDEITY:1,HLeid																			DESC:You bear a birthmark in the shape of the holy symbol of Hleid somewhere on your body; this mark identifies you as an ally of the church of Hleid. &nl; - Increase your Wisdom score by 1, to a maximum of 20. &nl; - You are immune to Rimefire Bolt of Rimefire Eidolon. Additionally you can handle Rimefire Ice barehanded without taking any cold damage. &nl; - You gain +2 bonus to CA against Demon, Devil and Undead. &nl; - You get +2 TS against Cold damage.																BONUS:STAT|WIS|1								SOURCEPAGE:HaF	
